  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 13 September 2021). Our client Bhavana Bansal is a 38-year-old dentist who lives at Flat 17A, Sitabuldi, Nagpur 440001 and can be reached on +91 99698 94961 or bhavana.bansal99@example.com. The client's PAN JQGPB3805U.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Gayatri Hegde. A cheque for ₹37,40,000 issued by Gayatri Hegde bounced: the cheque came back with the remark account closed.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 873196873264 (IFSC KKBK0888972).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 2009/2021 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Nagpur on 30 November 2021.",
